Subject: [PATCH] net: mediatek: balance MAC ownership and quiesce teardown

Track successful notifier registration and release the default phylink
separately from borrowed mux channels. Unwind partial PCS acquisition and
MAC allocation once, and keep NAPI, clocks and PCS alive until netdevice
unregistration closes every running port. Drain producers and diagnostics
before removing their backing device. Propagate reset-notifier and mux
setup errors and release their partial resources.

